From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:45:17 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] neogeo-bios

FBNeo loads a Neo Geo set with no BIOS without an error and draws its
640x480 missing-ROM page. Before a Neo Geo set is inserted, from the
shelf or resumed at boot (both through App::insert), slot reads the zip
directory of BIOS/neogeo.zip: unless it holds the four files the default
MVS Asia/Europe ver. 6 BIOS boots with (sp-s3.sp1, sm1.sm1, sfix.sfix and
000-lo.lo, matched by crc32 like FBNeo does, so asia-s3.rom counts), the
set stays on the shelf with the refusal shake and the toast "Neo Geo
needs BIOS/neogeo.zip". CPS1 and CPS2 need no BIOS. slot never ships or
fetches the file. The toast is its own list after the Lynx toasts.
